				},
				{
					"Source":
					{
						"Text": "The processing of Chlorine: make sure not to breath it in!"
					},
					"Translation":
					{
						"Text": "Le traitement du chlore. Faîtes attention à ne pas le respirer !"
					},
					"Key": "ChlorineProcessing/Desc"
				},
				{
					"Source":
					{
						"Text": "The second tier of transition metal refining. Unlocks new recipes and new ores."
					},
					"Translation":
					{
						"Text": "Le deuxième niveau du raffinage des métaux de transition. Débloque de nouvelles recettes et de nouveaux minerais."
					},
					"Key": "AdvancedTransitionMetalSciencePack/Desc"
				},
				{
					"Source":
					{
						"Text": "The use of new and more acidic fluids to refine new products."
					},
					"Translation":
					{
						"Text": "Méthodes de raffinage de minerai utilisant un nouvel acide, plus puissant."
					},
					"Key": "AdvancedTransitionMetalRefining/Desc"
				},
				{
					"Source":
					{
						"Text": "Transition Metal Science Pack"
					},
					"Translation":
					{
						"Text": "Pack de science des métaux de transition"
					},
					"Key": "TransitionMetalSciencePack/Name"
				},
